{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type HotkeySequenceRecorderCommitKeys = \"enter\" | \"none\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts#L25","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts:25"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"How the user can commit a recorded sequence from the keyboard."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'enter'"},{"type":"text","value":": plain Enter (no modifiers) commits when at least one step exists."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'none'"},{"type":"text","value":": only "},{"type":"link","href":"../classes/HotkeySequenceRecorder.md#commit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HotkeySequenceRecorder.commit"}]},{"type":"text","value":" finishes recording (or idle timeout if set)."}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype HotkeySequenceRecorderCommitKeys = \"enter\" | \"none\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts#L25)\n\nHow the user can commit a recorded sequence from the keyboard.\n- `'enter'`: plain Enter (no modifiers) commits when at least one step exists.\n- `'none'`: only [HotkeySequenceRecorder.commit](../classes/HotkeySequenceRecorder.md#commit) finishes recording (or idle timeout if set).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HotkeySequenceRecorderCommitKeys\ntitle: HotkeySequenceRecorderCommitKeys\n---\n\n```ts\ntype HotkeySequenceRecorderCommitKeys = \"enter\" | \"none\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey-sequence-recorder.ts#L25)\n\nHow the user can commit a recorded sequence from the keyboard.\n- `'enter'`: plain Enter (no modifiers) commits when at least one step exists.\n- `'none'`: only [HotkeySequenceRecorder.commit](../classes/HotkeySequenceRecorder.md#commit) finishes recording (or idle timeout if set).\n"}
